{"title":"2025 Putnam","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The 86th <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=William_Lowell_Putnam_Mathematical_Competition\" title=\"William Lowell Putnam Mathematical Competition\">William Lowell Putnam Mathematical Competition</a> took place on December 6th, 2025. The first and eighth links contain problems of each session. Rest of the links contain each problem individually and it's solution.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems\" title=\"2025 Putnam A Problems\">Session A</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 Putnam A Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Problem A1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 Putnam A Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Problem A2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 Putnam A Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Problem A3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 Putnam A Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Problem A4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 Putnam A Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Problem A5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 Putnam A Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Problem A6</a></li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_Putnam_B_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 Putnam B Problems (page does not exist)\">Session B</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\